cw_first	one
cw_created	one
no_time_before	one
creator_before	one
beginning_creation	one
beginning_time	one
time_not_yet	one
# The text does play on "wisdom": the uncreated Wisdom coeternal with God versus the created intellectual nature.
# Here P3 and P4 keep the two apart, and every statement using cw_created means the created one.
# "Before" means priority of origin, not of time, both in "created before all things" and in "the Eternity of the Creator is before it".
# Each of those claims keeps one sense across the statements that use it, and no premise or assumption carries a word between senses.
